    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d776">

                <pb facs="0900" n="804" sameAs="frus:frus1921v02/pg804"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.48/1501</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Norway</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Schmedeman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Christiania</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-07-15"><hi rendition="#italic">July 15,
                        1921</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received July 29.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1869</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to refer to my cable No.
                        33,<anchor n="18" xml:id="d776-f1"/> dated the 15th instant, giving summary
                    of a telegram received on the 13th instant by Doctor Nansen,<anchor n="19"
                        xml:id="d776-f2"/> from Maxim Gorky, [through the?] Commissariat for Foreign
                    Affairs at Moscow, making an appeal to the North American Nation through the
                    Archbishop of New York asking for bread and medicines for the Russian
                    population, who are suffering because of epidemics and crop failure in many
                    provinces caused by drought. A full copy of this telegram is sent herewith as
                    enclosure No. 1.</p>
                <p>After consulting me as to the course of action to be taken Dr. Nansen sent a
                    reply to Maxim Gorky, a copy of which is enclosed herewith as enclosure No.
                    2.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. G. Schmedeman</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d776-a1.xml" xpointer="d776-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d776-a2.xml" xpointer="d776-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
